---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Living in Walton-on-Thames | Schools & Local Services"
  description="What it's like to live in Walton-on-Thames, Hersham and Whiteley Village — local news, clubs and groups, schools, and council services."
>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="breadcrumbs">
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-current="page">Living</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h1>Living in Walton-on-Thames</h1>
      <p>Local news, clubs and groups, schools, and links to council services across Walton-on-Thames, Hersham and Whiteley Village.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Fast facts</h2>
        <p>The civic and public-service basics for Walton-on-Thames, at a glance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="facts-table-wrap">
        <table class="facts-table">
          <tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">Borough</th><td>Elmbridge Borough Council</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">County council</th><td>Surrey County Council</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Future unitary authority</th><td>East Surrey Council, from 1 April 2027</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Parliamentary constituency</th><td>Esher and Walton</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Current MP</th><td>Monica Harding, Liberal Democrat (elected July 2024)</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Police force</th><td>Surrey Police</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Fire and rescue</th><td>Surrey Fire and Rescue Service</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Ambulance service</th><td>South East Coast Ambulance Service NHS Foundation Trust</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">NHS integrated care board</th><td>NHS Surrey and Sussex Integrated Care Board, from 1 April 2026</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Main acute NHS trust</th><td>Ashford and St Peter's Hospitals NHS Foundation Trust</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Bus operators</th><td>Falcon Buses and White Bus</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="facts-note">Surrey is undergoing local government reorganisation: the current county/borough structure is due to be replaced by new unitary councils, with Walton-on-Thames and Hersham expected to fall within East Surrey Council from 1 April 2027. Until then, current services continue via Elmbridge Borough Council and Surrey County Council — see <a href="/living/council-and-services/">council & services</a> for links.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-tinted">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="community-grid">
        <a href="/community/news/" class="community-card">
          <span class="community-icon">📰</span>
          <h2>Local News</h2>
          <p>Community stories, local history features, and news from across the three neighbourhoods.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/living/community/" class="community-card">
          <span class="community-icon">🤝</span>
          <h2>Clubs & Groups</h2>
          <p>Sports clubs, societies, community organisations and social groups.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/living/schools/" class="community-card">
          <span class="community-icon">🏫</span>
          <h2>Schools</h2>
          <p>Primary and secondary schools serving Walton-on-Thames, Hersham and the surrounding area.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/living/council-and-services/" class="community-card">
          <span class="community-icon">🏛️</span>
          <h2>Council & Services</h2>
          <p>Links to Elmbridge Borough Council, Surrey County Council, libraries, bins, and local NHS services.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/living/post-offices-and-post-boxes/" class="community-card">
          <span class="community-icon">📮</span>
          <h2>Post Offices & Post Boxes</h2>
          <p>Post Office branches, the Royal Mail Delivery Office, and postbox locations across the area.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .facts-table-wrap {
    background: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .facts-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
  }

  .facts-table tr:not(:last-child) {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(11,36,46,0.06);
  }

  .facts-table th,
  .facts-table td {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .facts-table th {
    color: var(--color-slate);
    font-weight: 600;
    width: 40%;
  }

  .facts-table td {
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }

  .facts-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-slate);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 70ch;
  }

  .community-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .community-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .community-card:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card-hover);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    color: inherit;
  }

  .community-icon { font-size: 2rem; }

  .community-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }

  .community-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-slate);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .community-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
